title Strangler-fig migration
direction right

Clients [icon: users]
Facade [icon: split, color: blue, description: routes by path]

Legacy monolith [icon: server, color: gray] {
  Accounts module [icon: user]
  Orders module [icon: cart]
  Inventory module [icon: package]
  Reporting module [icon: chart]
  Monolith DB [icon: mysql, shape: cylinder]
}
New platform [icon: kubernetes, color: green] {
  Accounts service [icon: user]
  Orders service [icon: cart]
  Orders DB [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder]
  Inventory service [icon: package, description: in progress]
}
Sync [color: orange] {
  CDC stream [icon: kafka]
  Anti-corruption layer [icon: shield]
}

Clients > Facade
Facade > Legacy monolith: /reports, /inventory
Facade > New platform: /accounts, /orders
Accounts module, Orders module, Inventory module, Reporting module > Monolith DB
Orders service > Orders DB
Monolith DB --> CDC stream: changes
CDC stream > Anti-corruption layer > New platform
Inventory service -- Inventory module: dual write
Legacy monolith --> New platform: shrinking
